; CALIBRATION STROKES: 15 strokes, middle of the card -> bottom edge, 64 mm long.
; Left to right: max height 3, 6, 9, 12, 16 mm (groups of 3),
; attack inside each group: lift over 10, 25, 45 mm (fast -> slow).
; Every stroke: 1.5 mm pressed for the first 12 mm, then smooth lift.
; offsets from data/calibration.json: X -14.5  Y +7.1  Z +1.1
; BEFORE STARTING: cartridge OFF (G28 raises the bed to nozzle height). Card in the frame.
; Load the brush with paint by hand at the pause.
M104 S0
M140 S0
M107
G21
G90
G28 ; home with the cartridge off
G1 Z65.10 F600 ; bed down for attaching the brush
M400
M117 Attach loaded brush, Resume
@pause ; snap the cartridge on (brush loaded with paint), then press Resume
G1 Z26.10 F600 ; stay well clear of the paper and frame
